      48.81,
      398.17,
      539.0,
      457.24
    ],
    "text": "BY virtue of the powers vested in me under Section 10A of the Customs Ordinance (Chapter 235) as amended by Act,No. 83 of 1988, I, Ravi Karunanayake, Finance Minister of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka with theapproval of the Cabinet of Ministers, do by this order impose in respect of the commodity item specified in Column I ofthe Shedule hereto a Surcharge in the interest of the national economy, at the rates specified in the corresponding entriesin Column II of that Schedule from 22nd September, 2015 till 08th October, 2015.",
